<title>INDIA: India TISCO Q1 97/98 exports up 23 pct.</title>
<headline>India TISCO Q1 97/98 exports up 23 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tata Iron and Steel Company Ltd's (TISCO) exports rose 23 percent in the first quarter of 1997/98 (April-March) from the same period a year ago, Chairman Ratan Tata told a shareholders' meeting on Thursday.</p>
</text>
